cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these proofs or their verification code, please cite this work."
title: "Project Lemma: C(70,21,2) and the first Mills number L(14)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Valiyaparampil
    given-names: Troy
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 proofs that the covering number C(70,21,2) is 15 and the first
  Mills number L(14) is 7/23. The latter verifies the q=3 case of
  Füredi's conjecture from 1990 and 1994. The repository includes independent covering
  certificate verifiers. The papers credit Troy Valiyaparampil and GPT-6.2
  Astra. GPT-6.2 Sol sessions contributed review, certificate checks, and
  Lean modules.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - covering designs
  - Lean 4
  - fractional matchings
  - Mills numbers
